<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
  <tr>
    <td width="20"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="35" height="1"></td>
    <td width="578">
	<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
      <tr>
        <td valign="top">
						<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">July 22, 2001 <strong>Dreadyn VS. Ragefire... Kitty Wins!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=52"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=52&a=18"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">After many hours of studying every pixel in the Lair of Sol B, Dreadyn received a visit from Ragefire.  The troops assembled and &quot;had a talk&quot; with the Dragon.  CONGRATS TO DREADYN!!!!  Rez me please!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=18">Tinkle</a> <small>12:41pm est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">July 08, 2001 <strong>Trak died or something.</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=51"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=51&a=66"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Grats Lorrac on Pally BP and Larg on Druid BP.  Grizzy, Qwillian, Sirana, and Digriz are no longer toofless.</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=66">Zurin</a> <small>12:10am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">June 27, 2001 <strong>this just in!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=50"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=50&a=42"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">there is no news to add</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=42">Lazaruss</a> <small>4:14pm est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">June 15, 2001 <strong>Mission Duckhead Completed!!!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=49"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=49&a=17"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Tinkle now has the remains of his rubber ducky mounted on a stick in protest of rubber ducky killers everywhere!<br>
<br>
Grats to Tinkle on his epic! :) Thanks to LH and our friends for all your help throughout this long haul!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=17">Diggo</a> <small>1:06am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">June 06, 2001 <strong>LH>Faydedar ... DUH!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=48"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=48&a=66"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">This evening LH paid a visit to the beautiful hidden oasis in Timorous Deep.<br>
Faydedar was no match for the 3 groups of LH and a few of our friends from RoH.<br>
The only Death of the evening was Faydedar's.  Grats to Ambien on his loot =)</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=66">Zurin</a> <small>2:51am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">June 02, 2001 <strong>Royal Success!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=47"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=47&a=3"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Today LH &amp; Friends stormed Chardok -  Congrats to Galatera and Shanarian on epic pieces, and Congratulations Jedi Lifecrusher on obtaining his glow sticks!  Rar!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=3">Fenya</a> <small>5:18pm est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">May 31, 2001 <strong>Trakanon Dead ... again</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=46"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=46&a=66"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">36 of us with only 1 mage as a nuker managed to take out Trak in about 30 seconds.  Grats Mordone on Manna Robe and Elling on Cloak of Piety.  Teeth went to Demari, Skuerto, Antar and Bindel.  Dreadyn found out that Traknon doesn't like cat hats, but perhaps the most impressive thing about tonight was Grimmlok not dying =D</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=66">Zurin</a> <small>3:44am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
